                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:3em;\"><strong>One country, three religions. </strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:1.75em;\"><strong>The Religious Dimension of the Israel-Palestine Conflict.</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\">Information and exercises</span></strong></p>\n"
