            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Peace Process</strong><br>\nThere have been many attempts to advance the peace process, but they have often failed due to deep-seated mistrust and disagreements. Religious differences have made the peace process more difficult, as they often lead to irreconcilable positions.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Future Prospects</strong><br>\nThe future of the conflict remains uncertain. Without a solution that takes into account the religious and national claims of both sides, it is difficult to see how lasting peace can be achieved. The religious dimension of the conflict makes a solution even more complicated.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Importance for Youth</strong><br>\nIt is important for young people to be informed about this conflict and its religious dimension. By understanding the different perspectives and the deeply rooted history, they can form an informed opinion and perhaps contribute to solutions in the future.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3d655444-fd55-42f7-aba2-16a16db7dc58"
            },
